1
00:01:14,449 --> 00:01:16,449
Where's Mom?

2
00:01:16,449 --> 00:01:29,339
She went to a school-board meeting.

3
00:01:29,339 --> 00:02:08,052
I don't know how she does it.

4
00:02:08,052 --> 00:02:10,052
She sure keeps busy.

5
00:02:10,052 --> 00:02:11,030
It's important to her.

6
00:02:11,030 --> 00:02:14,579
There are lots of places to go,

7
00:02:14,579 --> 00:02:16,986
lots of things to do.

8
00:02:16,986 --> 00:02:19,546
She can't sit around and do nothing.

9
00:02:19,546 --> 00:02:21,692
Philip works late. Philip

10
00:02:21,692 --> 00:02:23,275
I guess you're right.

11
00:02:23,275 --> 00:02:26,331
I wish I had her energy.

12
00:02:26,331 --> 00:02:27,154
Anybody home?

13
00:02:27,154 --> 00:02:28,898
We're in here, Dad.

14
00:02:28,898 --> 00:02:32,606
Oh. Hi, gang.

15
00:02:32,606 --> 00:02:33,336
Hello, Philip.

16
00:02:33,336 --> 00:02:34,854
How was your day?

17
00:02:34,854 --> 00:02:37,832
My day was just fine.

18
00:02:37,832 --> 00:02:39,832
So was my night.

19
00:02:39,832 --> 00:02:41,560
It's almost ten o'clock.

20
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,788
Mmm. I'm starving.

21
00:02:43,788 --> 00:02:45,074
Um ... where's Mom?

22
00:02:45,074 --> 00:02:47,654
She went to a school-board meeting.

23
00:02:47,654 --> 00:02:50,744
There's a note for you on the refrigerator.

24
00:02:50,744 --> 00:03:28,457
Oh?

25
00:03:28,457 --> 00:03:29,617
Did you have dinner, Robbie?

26
00:03:29,617 --> 00:03:30,457
Yeah.

27
00:03:30,457 --> 00:03:31,635
Mike and I had a hamburger at the diner. Mike

28
00:03:31,635 --> 00:03:33,035
I came home a little while ago.

29
00:03:33,035 --> 00:03:35,013
You've been working late

30
00:03:35,013 --> 00:03:36,813
almost every night this week, Dad.

31
00:03:36,813 --> 00:03:38,058
Aren't you exhausted?

32
00:03:38,058 --> 00:03:42,769
I don't have time to be exhausted.

33
00:03:42,769 --> 00:03:44,765
You and Mom haven't had dinner together with us

34
00:03:44,765 --> 00:03:46,325
in almost a full week.

35
00:03:46,325 --> 00:03:46,598
Yeah,

36
00:03:46,598 --> 00:03:47,416
I feel bad

37
00:03:47,416 --> 00:03:49,989
about us not having dinner with the family,

38
00:03:49,989 --> 00:03:52,281
but our schedules are so different.

39
00:03:52,281 --> 00:03:54,395
Either I'm at the hospital doing paperwork,

40
00:03:54,395 --> 00:03:58,237
or Mom is at a committee meeting.

41
00:03:58,237 --> 00:04:01,215
I frankly don't know what to do about it.

42
00:04:01,215 --> 00:04:03,615
I'm worried about you and Mom.

43
00:04:03,615 --> 00:04:05,873
You really have been working too hard.

44
00:04:05,873 --> 00:04:06,433
Well,

45
00:04:06,433 --> 00:04:08,691
I think I've had enough of that sandwich.

46
00:04:08,691 --> 00:04:13,127
You didn't finish it.

47
00:04:13,127 --> 00:04:17,485
It's not good to eat before going to bed.

48
00:04:17,485 --> 00:04:20,283
A cookie can't hurt, though.

49
00:04:20,283 --> 00:04:20,683
Well,

50
00:04:20,683 --> 00:04:24,140
I'm heading off for bed

51
00:04:24,140 --> 00:04:25,038
and a good night's sleep.

52
00:04:25,038 --> 00:04:28,016
Well, good night.

53
00:04:28,016 --> 00:04:29,516
Good night, Son.

54
00:04:29,516 --> 00:04:30,994
Good night, Dad.

55
00:04:30,994 --> 00:04:32,194
I'm going to bed.

56
00:04:32,194 --> 00:04:33,972
Good night, Philip.

57
00:04:33,972 --> 00:04:35,972
Haven't you finished balancing that checkbook?

58
00:04:35,972 --> 00:04:38,950
I found another mistake.

59
00:04:38,950 --> 00:04:51,840
I'll be off to bed myself in a minute.

60
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:53,220
OK. Good night.

61
00:04:53,220 --> 00:04:55,020
I'm really concerned about them,

62
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:55,230
Grandpa.

63
00:04:55,230 --> 00:04:56,231
Concerned about whom?

64
00:04:56,231 --> 00:04:57,796
About Mom and Dad.

65
00:04:57,796 --> 00:05:00,774
They hardly ever see each other.

66
00:05:00,774 --> 00:05:02,794
Dad often works late,

67
00:05:02,794 --> 00:05:05,466
and Mom has all these committees she's on.

68
00:05:05,466 --> 00:05:33,532
What do you propose to do about it?

69
00:05:33,532 --> 00:05:48,821
You have that look in your eye.

70
00:05:48,821 --> 00:05:56,252
I don't know,

71
00:05:56,252 --> 00:07:10,159
but there must be a way

72
00:07:10,159 --> 00:07:28,027
of getting them to spend more time together.

73
00:07:28,027 --> 00:07:31,027
Quality time.
